flowchart TB
  Admin[统一中台 React] --> Console[Console BFF 无数据库账号]
  User[期货业务前端] --> Business[Futures BFF 无数据库账号]
  Console --> Registry[Registry 资源与凭证]
  Console --> Hub[ToolHub Skill/MCP 治理]
  Console --> Knowledge[Knowledge]
  Console --> Runtime[Runtime 多实例]
  Business --> Registry
  Business --> Runtime
  Worker[Worker 多实例 + DSH] --> Hub
  Hub --> Runtime
  Runtime --> Hub
  Runtime --> Knowledge
  Runtime --> Sandbox[隔离 Sandbox]
  Worker --> Registry
  Knowledge --> Registry
  Indexer[Indexer 多实例] --> KnowledgeDB[(Knowledge schema)]
  Knowledge --> KnowledgeDB
  Hub --> HubDB[(ToolHub schema)]
  Registry --> RegistryDB[(资源/凭证表)]
  Worker --> RuntimeDB[(运行/回执/原始记录)]
  Runtime --> RuntimeDB
  Storage[Storage] --> RuntimeDB
  Telemetry[异步 Telemetry] --> RuntimeDB
  Indexer --> RAG[外部 Milvus / LightRAG / Embedding]
  subgraph 当前同一 PostgreSQL 实例 各服务独立账号
    KnowledgeDB
    HubDB
    RegistryDB
    RuntimeDB
  end
